<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>品味 on Yousa Driven Development | YDD</title><link>https://yousali.com/tags/%E5%93%81%E5%91%B3/</link><description>Recent content in 品味 on Yousa Driven Development | YDD</description><generator>Hugo -- 0.148.1</generator><language>zh</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:10:25 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://yousali.com/tags/%E5%93%81%E5%91%B3/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>商贩叫它们“下手物”，柳宗悦和同伴造出了“民艺”</title><link>https://yousali.com/stories/yanagi-soetsu-mingei-craft/</link><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yousali.com/stories/yanagi-soetsu-mingei-craft/</guid><description>1914 年因浅川伯教所赠的一只李朝青花壶起兴，柳宗悦在访朝与移居京都后开始收集早市上的日常器具“下手物”，以不受成见束缚的“直观”看待它们，并与同伴造出“民艺”一词，最终将这些器物送入日本民艺馆的陈列。</description></item></channel></rss>